    rdfs:label "H2 optimal approximation"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This approach is based on the interpolation of the Volterra series representation of the system's transfer function and gives a local H2-optimal approximation, because the interpolation is chosen so that the system satisfies the necessary H2-optimality conditions upon convergence of the algorithm. Note that H2 stands for Hardy space." ;
