    mathmoddb:P1459 "Enzyme (E) and Substrate (S) form an enzyme-substrate complex (ES), which catalyzes the formation of product (P). Rates for complex formation and dissociation are k₁ and k₋₁, k₂ is the rate of the rate-determining enzymatic step of product formation. Free enzyme may bind an inhibitor (I) to form an enzyme-inhibitor complex (EI) with rates k₃ and k₋₃." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534269" ;
