<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6684687> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534292> ;
    rdfs:label "uni uni reaction with competitive partial inhibition"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "Enzyme (E) and Substrate (S) form an enzyme-substrate complex (ES), which catalyzes the formation of product (P). Rates for complex formation and dissociation are k₁ and k₋₁, k₂ is the rate of the rate-determining enzymatic step of product formation. Free enzyme and the enzyme-substrate complex may bind an inhibitor (I) to form an enzyme-inhibitor (EI) and enzyme-inhibitor-substrate complex (EIS) with k₃ or k₋₃ and k₄ or k₋₄ as rates of inhibitor complex formation and depletion. Enzyme-inhibitor complex and enzyme-inhibitor-substrate convert into each other with rates k₅ and k₋₅. From the enzyme-inhibitor-substrate complex product is formed with rate k₂. Properly this is a mixed partial inhibition in which the inhibitor does not affect the turnover rate." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534269" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P1684 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6684665" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534292" ;
    schema:description "uni uni reaction with inhibition"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6684688> a owl:NamedIndividual,
