    rdfs:label "uni uni reaction with reversible partial inhibition"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "Uni Uni Reaction with reversible inhibition. The enzyme-inhibitor-substrate complex (EIS) can form product, the inhibition is thus partial." ;
