    mathmoddb:P12 "Q7193" ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "Microbiology is the scientific study of microorganisms, including bacteria, viruses, fungi, and other microscopic life forms. It explores their structure, function, ecology, and roles in health, disease, and the environment. The discipline connects fundamental biology with applications in medicine, biotechnology, and industry." ;
