    rdfs:label "bacterial growth"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P12 "Q762045" ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "The bacterial growth problem examines how bacteria multiply and change over time under varying environmental and nutrient conditions. It explores factors such as temperature, nutrient availability, and competition that influence the rate and extent of bacterial population growth." ;
