        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
    rdfs:label "evaluation of biokinetic parameters"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This task performs nonlinear parameter estimation using experimental data for biomass concentration and substrate concentration in a bioreactor. The objective is to determine key kinetic parameters, including the maximum specific growth rate, Monod constant, inhibition constant, and death rate coefficient, by fitting a dynamic model of biomass growth and substrate consumption to the observed data." ;
