    rdfs:label "linear parameter estimation (Hill-de Boer model)"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This task performs linear parameter estimation using experimental adsorption equilibrium data. The objective is to determine the Hill–de Boer constant and the interaction energy constant by fitting the linearized Hill–de Boer equation to measured equilibrium concentration and fractional surface coverage data. The resulting parameters describe adsorption affinity and the strength of lateral interactions among adsorbed molecules." ;
