<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821263> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
    rdfs:label "nonlinear parameter estimation (UNILAN model)"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This task consists of estimating the UNILAN isotherm parameters by fitting the nonlinear UNILAN equation to experimental equilibrium adsorption data. The fitted parameters typically include the maximum adsorption capacity, the adsorption affinity constant, and the heterogeneity parameter. Nonlinear regression methods are required due to the logarithmic and exponential structure of the model. The task is commonly used to characterize surface heterogeneity and adsorption energetics in heterogeneous adsorbent systems." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P1560 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821262" ;
    mathmoddb:P1684 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775767" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6672087" ;
    schema:description "nonlinear estimation of UNILAN adsorption parameters"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821264> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q68663> ;
    rdfs:label "UNILAN isotherm model"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "The UNILAN isotherm model is an empirical adsorption model derived by assuming a uniform distribution of adsorption energies over a heterogeneous surface. It is based on a patchwise surface concept, where each patch follows a local Langmuir isotherm, and the overall adsorption behavior is obtained by integrating over all patches. The model provides correct asymptotic behavior at both low and high solute concentrations. UNILAN is particularly useful for describing heterogeneous adsorption systems where energy variation is bounded and uniformly distributed. In the limit of vanishing heterogeneity, the model reduces to the classical Langmuir isotherm." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534270" ;
    mathmoddb:P147 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821263" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P1560 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821262" ;
    mathmoddb:P1684 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775766" ;
    mathmoddb:P286 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775858" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775551" ;
    schema:description "empirical adsorption model with uniform energy distribution"@en .

