<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822032> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q96183> ;
    rdfs:label "crop nitrogen demand equation"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This equation estimates the daily nitrogen demand of the crop as the difference between the ideal nitrogen content of the current biomass and the cumulative nitrogen uptake up to the previous day. The ideal nitrogen content is calculated as the product of accumulated biomass and an optimal nitrogen concentration. The formulation represents nitrogen demand as a dynamic, history-dependent quantity that increases with growth and decreases as nitrogen is taken up. It provides the demand side of the nitrogen balance used in the uptake adjustment." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775550" ;
    mathmoddb:P983 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>D</mi></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    mathmoddb:P989 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><munderover><mo movablelimits=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">∑</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></munderover><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>K</mi></mrow></msub></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    schema:description "estimates daily crop nitrogen demand from biomass and uptake history"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822033> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q96183> ;
    rdfs:label "optimal plant nitrogen concentration equation"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This equation describes the decline of optimal plant nitrogen concentration with crop development stage. The concentration is modeled as a nonlinear function of the heat unit index using crop-specific parameters. It reflects the physiological tendency of plants to have high nitrogen concentrations during early growth and lower concentrations near maturity. The formulation provides a smooth, development-dependent target nitrogen concentration for demand estimation." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6672094" ;
    mathmoddb:P983 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>H</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>I</mi></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    mathmoddb:P989 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mi>b</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">+</mo><mi>b</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mi>b</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi>H</mi><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></msup></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    schema:description "estimates ideal crop nitrogen concentration as function of development"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822034> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q96183> ;
    rdfs:label "nitrogen supply by mass flow equation"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This equation estimates the nitrogen supply from each soil layer based on mass flow of nitrate to plant roots. Nitrogen supply is computed as the product of plant water uptake in the layer and nitrate concentration in soil water. The formulation assumes that nitrate transport to roots is proportional to water flux, reflecting mass flow as the dominant nitrogen transport mechanism. It provides a layer-resolved estimate of potential nitrogen supply from the soil." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775550" ;
    mathmoddb:P983 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>W</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    mathmoddb:P989 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mfrac><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>W</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><msub><mn>3</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    schema:description "distributes potential nitrogen supply across soil layers by water uptake"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822035> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q96183> ;
    rdfs:label "total soil nitrogen supply equation"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This equation computes the total nitrogen supply available to the crop by summing the layer-specific nitrogen supply rates. It represents the total nitrogen that could be taken up by mass flow on a given day. The result serves as an intermediate quantity used to compare soil nitrogen availability with crop nitrogen demand. It links soil-layer processes to whole-plant nitrogen uptake." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775550" ;
    mathmoddb:P983 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>S</mi></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    mathmoddb:P989 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><munderover><mo movablelimits=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">∑</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>M</mi></mrow></munderover><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    schema:description "aggregates nitrogen supply from all soil layers"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822036> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q96183> ;
    rdfs:label "adjusted nitrogen supply rate in soil layer constraint"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "Adjusted nitrogen supply should not exceed soil nitrate content" ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775550" ;
    mathmoddb:P983 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>W</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    mathmoddb:P989 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">≤</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><msub><mn>3</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    schema:description "constraint for the adjusted nitrogen supply rate"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822037> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q96183> ;
    rdfs:label "adjusted nitrogen uptake equation"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This equation scales the layer-specific nitrogen supply to ensure consistency with total crop nitrogen demand. When mass flow supply exceeds demand, uptake is reduced proportionally across layers; when supply is insufficient, the formulation allows increased uptake, representing diffusion-driven compensation. An upper constraint ensures that uptake from a layer cannot exceed the available nitrate in that layer. The equation produces the actual nitrogen uptake used by the crop model." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775550" ;
    mathmoddb:P983 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>a</mi></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    mathmoddb:P989 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mfrac><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    schema:description "adjusts soil nitrogen supply to crop nitrogen demand"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822038> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
    rdfs:label "computation of crop nitrogen demand"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This task computes the daily nitrogen demand of the crop based on accumulated biomass and an optimal nitrogen concentration that depends on development stage. It accounts for nitrogen already taken up in previous days and produces a dynamic demand signal. The result represents the nitrogen requirement needed to sustain optimal growth." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P1560 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822033" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775549" ;
    schema:description "determine daily nitrogen demand of the crop"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822039> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
    rdfs:label "computation of soil nitrogen supply by mass flow"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This task estimates the nitrogen supplied to plant roots from each soil layer through mass flow driven by plant water uptake. It combines soil nitrate content, soil water content, and layer-specific plant water use. The task produces a spatially distributed estimate of nitrogen supply from the soil." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P1560 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822034" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775549" ;
    schema:description "estimating potential nitrogen supply from soil layers"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822040> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
    rdfs:label "aggregation of soil nitrogen supply"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This task aggregates nitrogen supply across all soil layers to determine the total nitrogen available for uptake by the crop on a given day. The result is used to assess whether soil nitrogen supply is sufficient to meet crop nitrogen demand." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P1560 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822039" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775549" ;
    schema:description "compute total nitrogen supply from all soil layers"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822041> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
    rdfs:label "adjustment of nitrogen uptake to crop demand"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This task adjusts the potential nitrogen supply from each soil layer to ensure consistency with crop nitrogen demand. It enforces upper bounds based on soil nitrate availability and allows compensation when mass flow alone is insufficient. The result represents the actual nitrogen uptake used in crop growth calculations." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P1560 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822040" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775549" ;
    schema:description "scaling nitrogen uptake to match crop demand"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822042> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q68663> ;
    rdfs:label "plant nitrogen uptake and demand model"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This model simulates crop nitrogen use using a supply–demand framework. Crop nitrogen demand is computed from accumulated biomass and an ideal nitrogen concentration that varies with crop development. Soil nitrogen supply is estimated from nitrate transport to roots by mass flow, distributed across soil layers according to plant water uptake. Actual nitrogen uptake is obtained by adjusting soil nitrogen supply to match crop demand while respecting soil nitrate availability. The model links crop growth, soil water use, and nitrogen dynamics in a mechanistic way." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534270" ;
    mathmoddb:P147 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822038" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P1560 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822037" ;
    mathmoddb:P286 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821276" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q68663" ;
    schema:description "simulation of crop nitrogen demand and soil nitrogen uptake"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822043> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534292> ;
    rdfs:label "estimation of crop nitrogen uptake under varying soil conditions"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This research problem concerns the estimation of crop nitrogen uptake as constrained by plant demand and soil nitrogen availability. It addresses how nitrogen demand evolves with crop growth and how soil processes supply nitrogen to roots through water-driven transport. The problem is central to understanding nutrient limitations on crop productivity and nitrogen cycling in agroecosystems." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534269" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P1513 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822042" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534292" ;
    schema:description "quantify crop nitrogen demand and soil nitrogen supply"@en .

