<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822104> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q96183> ;
    rdfs:label "daily nitrogen fixation equation"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This equation estimates the daily amount of biologically fixed nitrogen in legume crops as a fraction of plant nitrogen demand. The daily fixation is computed by multiplying the plant nitrogen demand rate by a daily fixation fraction. The equation represents the core nitrogen fixation calculation and links plant nitrogen status, environmental conditions, and phenological development to the actual daily nitrogen acquired from atmospheric sources." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775550" ;
    mathmoddb:P983 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>F</mi><mi>X</mi><mi>R</mi></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    mathmoddb:P989 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>W</mi><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>X</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    schema:description "daily nitrogen fixation from plant demand"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822105> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q96183> ;
    rdfs:label "nitrogen fixation fraction equation"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This equation computes the fraction of plant nitrogen demand that can be met by biological nitrogen fixation. It combines multiple limiting factors representing plant phenology, soil water status, and soil nitrate availability. The fixation fraction is constrained by the most limiting environmental factor and modulated by plant growth stage, representing physiological and environmental controls on symbiotic nitrogen fixation." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6672079" ;
    mathmoddb:P983 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>F</mi><mi>X</mi><mi>N</mi></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    mathmoddb:P989 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>F</mi><mi>X</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mo>min</mo><mo>&#x2061;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>X</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>X</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>X</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    schema:description "combined environmental fixation limitation"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822106> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q96183> ;
    rdfs:label "fixation growth stage equation"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "These piecewise equations define the growth-stage-dependent factor controlling nitrogen fixation. The factor represents the development and senescence of symbiotic nodules, suppressing fixation in early and late growth stages and allowing full fixation during mid-season. The formulation uses the heat unit index as a phenological proxy." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6672094" ;
    mathmoddb:P983 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>F</mi><mi>X</mi><mi>G</mi></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    mathmoddb:P989 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>F</mi><mi>X</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd class=\"mwe-math-columnalign-l\"><mn>0.0</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mtd><mtd class=\"mwe-math-columnalign-l\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>if</mtext></mrow></mtd><mtd><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>H</mi><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">≤</mo><mn>0.15</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">≥</mo><mn>0.75</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class=\"mwe-math-columnalign-l\"><mn>6.67</mn><mi>H</mi><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mtd><mtd class=\"mwe-math-columnalign-l\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>if</mtext></mrow></mtd><mtd><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0.15</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">≤</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class=\"mwe-math-columnalign-l\"><mn>1.0</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mtd><mtd class=\"mwe-math-columnalign-l\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>if</mtext></mrow></mtd><mtd><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0.3</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">≤</mo><mn>0.55</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class=\"mwe-math-columnalign-l\"><mn>3.75</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mn>5.0</mn><mi>H</mi><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mtd><mtd class=\"mwe-math-columnalign-l\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>if</mtext></mrow></mtd><mtd><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mn>0.55</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.75</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" symmetric=\"true\" data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\"></mo></mrow></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    schema:description "phenological control of nitrogen fixation"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822107> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q96183> ;
    rdfs:label "fixation soil water equation"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "This equation computes a soil water limitation factor for nitrogen fixation based on topsoil moisture relative to field capacity and wilting point. Fixation is reduced when soil moisture falls below a threshold fraction of available water capacity and is not limited when soil moisture exceeds this threshold. The formulation represents moisture stress effects on symbiotic activity." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6672094" ;
    mathmoddb:P983 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>F</mi><mi>X</mi><mi>W</mi></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    mathmoddb:P989 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>F</mi><mi>X</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd class=\"mwe-math-columnalign-l\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mfrac><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>S</mi><mi>W</mi><msub><mn>3</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>0.85</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mtd><mtd class=\"mwe-math-columnalign-l\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>if</mtext></mrow></mtd><mtd><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>S</mi><mi>W</mi><msub><mn>3</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.85</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">+</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class=\"mwe-math-columnalign-l\"><mn>1.0</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mtd><mtd class=\"mwe-math-columnalign-l\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>if</mtext></mrow></mtd><mtd><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mi>S</mi><mi>W</mi><msub><mn>3</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">≥</mo><mn>0.85</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">+</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" symmetric=\"true\" data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\"></mo></mrow></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
    schema:description "soil moisture control of nitrogen fixation"@en .

<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822108> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q96183> ;
    rdfs:label "fixation soil nitrate equation"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "These equations describe inhibition of biological nitrogen fixation by mineral nitrate in the root zone. Fixation is fully allowed at low nitrate levels, partially reduced at intermediate nitrate concentrations, and completely suppressed when nitrate exceeds a threshold. The formulation reflects physiological feedback where external nitrate reduces symbiotic nitrogen fixation activity." ;
    mathmoddb:P1460 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696" ;
    mathmoddb:P1495 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265" ;
    mathmoddb:P31 "https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775550" ;
    mathmoddb:P983 "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>W</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mrow></math>" ;
