    rdfs:label "soil phosphorus supply equation"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "Estimates soil phosphorus supply as a multiple of plant phosphorus demand, distributed among soil layers according to root biomass fractions and scaled by a labile phosphorus availability factor." ;
