    rdfs:label "plant phosphorus uptake and demand model"@en ;
    mathmoddb:P1459 "A deterministic agroecosystem model that estimates daily plant phosphorus demand based on biomass accumulation and optimal phosphorus concentration, and compares it with soil phosphorus supply determined by root distribution and labile soil phosphorus availability." ;
